    "description": "",
    "product_description": "",
    "product_short_description": "<div class=\"advaya-product-details\">   <p class=\"lead-summary\">     <strong>Fast-absorbing butter that hydrates, repairs barrier and       brightens skin.</strong>   </p>      <h3>Product Benefits</h3>   <div class=\"benefits-content\">       <p>Non-Greasy Hydration:<br/>The blend of mango butter and       fractionated coconut oil ensures quick absorption without a heavy residue.</p>     <p>Barrier Repair &amp; Protection:<br/>Shea butter and panthenol       work together to restore the skin\u2019s lipid barrier, preventing       moisture loss.</p>     <p>Skin Brightening &amp; Tone Correction:<br/>Niacinamide improves       texture and brightens uneven skin tone with consistent use.</p>     <p>Anti-Aging Benefits:<br/>Vitamin E and antioxidants protect the       skin from free radicals and early signs of aging.</p>     <p>Soothing &amp; Cooling Effect:<br/>Aloe vera and glycerin soothe       inflammation and give a naturally fresh feel, even in humid     weather.</p>   </div>    <h3>How to Use &amp; Rituals</h3>   <div class=\"usage-content\">     <p>Apply daily after shower or before       bedtime on dry areas like arms, legs, and elbows.</p>     <p>Suitable for all skin types, especially dry to combination.</p>     <p>Use year-round \u2013 especially after sun exposure or shaving to calm     skin.</p>   </div>    <h3>Ingredients</h3>   <p class=\"ingredients-list\">     <em>Aqua (Water), Shea Butter, Mango Butter, Cocoa Butter,       Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Jojoba Oil, Emulsifying Wax, Aloe       Vera Extract, Glycerin, Panthenol (Pro-Vitamin B5), Niacinamide,       Vitamin E, Phenoxyethanol, Natural Fragrance</em>   </p>      <div class=\"product-guarantee\">     <p>? <strong>100% Vegan         &amp; Cruelty Free</strong> | ?\u200d\u2640\ufe0f <strong>Formulated for Indian       Skin</strong> | ? <strong>Safe &amp; Non-Toxic</strong>     </p>   </div> </div>",
